# Mandatory Engineering Rules (إلزامي)

## 1. Clean Architecture placement

New domain logic goes under:

| Layer | Path |
|-------|------|
| Application | `app/Application/` |
| Domain | `app/Domain/` |
| Infrastructure | `app/Infrastructure/` |
| Presentation | `app/Presentation/` |

**Forbidden:** random root folders, duplicate services, putting business logic in React only when a backend service already exists.

**Before creating any file:** search the repo — reuse or extend; do not duplicate.

## 2. Allowed thin `app/` leftovers

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `app/Models/User.php` | Auth user model |
| `app/Providers/*` | Bootstrap, Gate::before |
| `app/Http/Middleware/*` | Global middleware |
| `app/Support/DatabaseSafetyGuard.php` | Production DB protection |
| `app/Console/Commands/*` | Ops / one-off backfills only when not Presentation |

Prefer `Presentation/Console/Commands` for domain artisan commands.

## 3. No git push / no migrate:fresh / no build unless asked

See sibling rules: `no-git-push-without-request.mdc`, `no-migrate-fresh.mdc`, `no-frontend-build-without-explicit-request.mdc`, `database-safety.mdc`.

## 4. Migrations

- Live in `database/migrations/` (this app is not nwidart-modular).
- PostgreSQL only — no MySQL-only syntax without driver guards.
- Prefer idempotent `Schema::hasTable` / `hasColumn` when restoring from shared dumps.
- **Never** `migrate:fresh` on `phyzioline_inventory`.

## 5. Scripts

Ops only under `/home/phyzioline-inventory/backup_*.sh` or documented ops paths — not ad-hoc domain tooling at repo root.
